This project provides the TrackMania Sunrise game profile, analysis tools,
build documentation, and compatibility patches for Recomp Toolkit.

The Recomp Toolkit patch is based on the toolkit's native implementation.
See patches/LICENSE.recomp-toolkit for the toolkit's license and copyright
notices.

TrackMania Sunrise and its original game data belong to their respective
rights holders. This repository requires a separately supplied game
installation and is unaffiliated with the original developers or publishers.
